      "widgets_values": [
        "HOW TO USE\n\n1. Pick your model in \"Load Checkpoint\" (this example is set up for Illustrious / NoobAI models).\n2. In \"Character Helper\", type a character's name and pick it from the list, then click \"Usual look\" to fill in their tags. Or click \"Randomize\".\n3. Change the tags however you like, then press Run.\n\nCharacter Helper outputs plain text. Here that text is joined with the quality tags and becomes the positive prompt. \"Final prompt\" shows what the model receives."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "HOW TO USE\n\n1. Pick your model in \"Load Checkpoint\" (this example is set up for Illustrious / NoobAI models).\n2. In \"Character Helper\", type a character's name and pick it from the list, then click \"Usual look\" to fill in their tags. Or click \"Randomize\".\n3. Change the tags however you like, then press Run.\n\nCharacter Helper outputs plain text. Here that text is joined with the quality tags and becomes the positive prompt. \"Final prompt\" shows what the model receives."
      },
